    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 6 Glenpark Close, Woodfarm Drive, Palmerstown, Dublin 20 to the market a superb three bedroom extended semi-detached family home ideally positioned within this mature and highly sought-after cul-de-sac setting. Woodfarm is one of Palmerstown's most established residential developments, renowned for its family-friendly atmosphere and unrivalled convenience. A wealth of local amenities can be found nearby including Liffey Valley Shopping Centre, local shops, cafés, restaurants and excellent sporting and recreational facilities. The area is also well served by a selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, while the N4 and M50 road networks provide swift access to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation spans to c. 80 sqm, and comprises of entrance hallway, lounge, dining area and extended kitchen/living space on the ground floor, while upstairs hosts three well-proportioned bedrooms and a main family bathroom. The extension adds valuable living space and enhances the property's suitability for modern family living.\nNo. 6 further benefits from off street parking to the front, side entrance, and a block-built shed to the rear, providing excellent storage or workshop potential. The property comes to the market with the added advantage of no onward chain, ensuring a smooth and straightforward transaction for the successful purchaser.\nWhether you're a first-time buyer looking to step onto the property ladder or a growing family seeking a home in a well-established neighborhood, No. 6 offers an excellent opportunity in a location that continues to prove exceptionally popular. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\n\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 80 sqm\n• BER D1\n• 3 Bed / 1 Bath\n• Semidetached home\n• Off street parking\n• Gas heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Sunny rear garden\n• Block built shed to the rear\n• Bright and airy\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• Ideal for a wide range of buyers\n• No onwards chain\n• Viewing highly advised!\n\nMeasurements;\nEntrance Hallway: 1.76m X 3.57m.\nLiving Room: 3.23m X 4.26m.\nDining Area: 2.41m X 4.09m.\nKitchen: 2.68m X 3.63m.\nBedroom 1: 3.01m X 3.39m.\nBedroom 2: 3.01m X 4.27m.\nBedroom 3: 2.36m X 2.40m.\nBathroom: 2.11m X 2.30m.\n\nDirections;\nEircode: D20 Y201"
      },
      {
